Good luck with your studies, Ned.

661
00:48:17,294 --> 00:48:18,712
Thank you, Professor.

662
00:48:19,546 --> 00:48:20,755
<i>Like reptiles...</i>

663
00:48:20,756 --> 00:48:23,215
{\an8}- Oh, God.
<i>- ...amphibians and arthropods,</i>

664
