688
00:49:34,913 --> 00:49:36,497
All right, E.V., let's do this.

689
00:49:36,498 --> 00:49:38,458
<i>Initiating field test one.</i>

690
00:49:40,419 --> 00:49:41,585
That's working.

691
00:49:41,586 --> 00:49:45,631
{\an8}<i>Alert. Inhibitor is overheating.
Functionality reducing.</i>

692
00:49:45,632 --> 00:49:47,425
Yeah, I'm sensing that.

693
00:49:47,426 --> 00:49:49,385
<i>Alert. Senses are overloaded.</i>

694
00:49:49,386 --> 00:49:52,806
<i>Alert. Senses are overloaded.
Senses are overloaded. Alert.</i>

695
00:49:54,182 --> 00:49:56,059
<i>Web grenades activated.</i>

696
00:49:58,145 --> 00:49:59,146
Oh, sh...

697
00:50:11,617 --> 00:50:13,994
<i>Inhibitor field test one, failure.</i>

698
00:50:16,830 --> 00:50:19,666
Yo, Spider-Man, you okay?

699
00:50:20,334 --> 00:50:22,419
Yeah. I'm just trying out some new tech.

700
