Yeah. To get rid
of that monster inside you?

701
00:50:31,303 --> 00:50:32,721
Still can't sense me, huh?

702
00:50:34,389 --> 00:50:36,266
Guess your technology isn't working.

703
00:50:37,434 --> 00:50:39,770
You know, you're the only person
I've met that I can't...

704
00:50:40,812 --> 00:50:42,022
hop into.

705
