I'm sure that's really
frustrating for you.

706
00:50:44,942 --> 00:50:46,442
I'll get in there one day.

707
00:50:46,443 --> 00:50:47,569
What do you want?

708
00:50:47,694 --> 00:50:48,695
Oh, boy.

709
00:50:49,446 --> 00:50:54,951
I wanna know why a half-human, half-spider
would decide to work for an organization

710
00:50:54,952 --> 00:50:58,497
