716
00:51:15,555 --> 00:51:16,932
Oh, you mean V-Max?

717
00:51:19,935 --> 00:51:23,146
I was planning to use Scorpion to get it,
but you keep getting in my way.

718
00:51:23,897 --> 00:51:26,482
